+    I_COMMIT -.->|Same content and current state| I_OPS
+    I_OPS --> I_PROOF
+    I_PREPLAN -.->|No implicit authority without a plan| I_ENGINE
+    I_REGISTRY -->|Current snapshot| I_ENGINE
